{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "damic-backend-collection-001",
    "name": "Damic Backend",
    "description": "Complete HTTP API collection for the Damic transportation backend.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `baseUrl` (default `http://127.0.0.1:3000`).\n2. Run **Auth → Login** — the test script saves `token` automatically.\n3. Run quote/KB/chat flows; IDs are saved into collection variables when responses succeed.\n\n**Auth**\nAdmin routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n**Socket.io** (not in Postman):\n- `chat:message`, `join:admin-queue`, `admin:claim`, `admin:message`\n- Events: `message:new`, `conversation:escalated`, `quote:new`, `conversation:claimed`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000"
    },
